{"3400050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval StartUp", "steam_appid": 3400050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.poster.avif?t=1783513867\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.webm?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.mp4?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage, Build, Explore and Prosper in Your Own Medieval StartUp!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the keeper of a tavern nestled deep within an ancient swamp, you’ll need to balance <strong>commerce, resources, and customer satisfaction</strong> to grow your establishment — and eventually build an entire village around your success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management</strong>: Serve your customers, manage your stock, and recruit workers to keep your business thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.poster.avif?t=1783513867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.webm?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.mp4?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Production</strong>: Turn your gathered resources into meals, drinks, and furniture. Unlock new professions such as <strong>carpentry, baking, blacksmithing, farming</strong>, and many more to discover as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Venture beyond your tavern to gather rare resources and uncover the forgotten secrets hidden in the swamp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development &amp; Expansion : </strong>Upgrade your tavern into a full inn, build guest rooms, open market stands, and diversify your sources of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.poster.avif?t=1783513867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.webm?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.mp4?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 <strong>Included Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hours of engaging gameplay with progression and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>50 unique recipes</strong> to unlock and craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete management system covering <strong>finances, staff, production, and loans</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to <strong>automate tasks</strong> as your StartUp grows.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 <strong>Graphics and Sound Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>polished low-poly art style</strong> for a cozy, stylized medieval feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dynamic day/night cycle</strong> with evolving lighting and ambience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>warm, living world</strong>, where every NPC adds life to your tavern and its surroundings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚧 <strong>In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Medieval StartUp</i> is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>.<br>New content will be added regularly, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>biomes</strong> and areas to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More <strong>recipes, items, and crafting options</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional <strong>quests, NPC interactions, and dynamic events</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Medieval StartUp,</strong> grow your small tavern into a thriving landmark at the heart of the kingdom!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.poster.avif?t=1783513867\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.webm?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.mp4?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage, Build, Explore and Prosper in Your Own Medieval StartUp!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the keeper of a tavern nestled deep within an ancient swamp, you’ll need to balance <strong>commerce, resources, and customer satisfaction</strong> to grow your establishment — and eventually build an entire village around your success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management</strong>: Serve your customers, manage your stock, and recruit workers to keep your business thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.poster.avif?t=1783513867\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.webm?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.mp4?t=1783513867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Production</strong>: Turn your gathered resources into meals, drinks, and furniture. Unlock new professions such as <strong>carpentry, baking, blacksmithing, farming</strong>, and many more to discover as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Venture beyond your tavern to gather rare resources and uncover the forgotten secrets hidden in the swamp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development &amp; Expansion : </strong>Upgrade your tavern into a full inn, build guest rooms, open market stands, and diversify your sources of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49e